Third-party components
----------------------

This license covers Kast.exe only. The download also contains two separate libraries
that keep their own licenses:

  libmpv-2.dll   mpv          GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later
  ffmpeg.exe     FFmpeg       GNU Lesser General Public License, version 3 or later

Both are unmodified LGPL builds from https://github.com/zhongfly/mpv-winbuild; their
complete source code is available from https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv and
https://ffmpeg.org. Kast loads libmpv dynamically and runs FFmpeg as a separate
program, so either file can be replaced by another compatible build. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the download for details.
